Host tests (no ESP-IDF, plain gcc/clang):

  CC=gcc sh test/host/run.sh                                            # rcc_codec, hmi_present, rcc_link
  powershell -File test/host/run.ps1                                    # same, with MinGW gcc on Windows
  python -m unittest discover -s test/host -p test_controller_sim.py -v # tools/controller_sim.py

UI pixel/morph regression: tools/sim/check.sh (see tools/sim/README.md).
